title: Funk in Six
key: Bb
tempo: 74
meter: 6/8
style: funk

// Two slow pulses to the bar, three eighths in each. A sixteen-bar verse that
// sits on the one, goes to the four and comes home, then turns round through
// the two and the five with a sharp-nine push into the two; an eight-bar
// chorus on the four that ends on two bars of a chord a pulse.
[Verse]
| Bb9 | %  | %   | %    |
| Eb9 | %  | Bb9 | %    |
| Cm7 | F9 | Bb9 | G7#9 |
| Cm7 | F9 | Bb9 | %    |

[Chorus]
| Eb9 | % | Bb9    | %      |
| Eb9 | % | Cm7 F9 | Bb9 F9 |
